resources.string:
"How do I add an application shortcut to my desktop?
\u0009(1) In the main interface to find you want to add to the desktop application;
\u0009(2) Long press the application icon, select desktop icon;
\u0009(3) Edit the icon and name,then you can find the shortcut in the desktop, and quickly start throught the shortcut;
\u0009Precautions:
\u0009(1) Parts of OPPO, vivo models with desktop do not support third-party application creation shortcuts, you can download other desktop to add;
\u0009(2) Ami desktop, APUS, Nano desktop, WP desktop, magic show desktop, etc. do not support third-party applications to create shortcuts;
\u0009(3) Xiaomi and other models need to go to the Security Center-authorization management-apply rights Management to create a desktop shortcut for the %1$s to manually authorize."
